        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_429 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "79. Incense Burner"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "069cdd73de0f9ea6a5548f9958a5376d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Kame whose father before her had been such an artist, was fond of drinking. She also smoked and associated with men most of the time. Whatever she made a little money she gave a feast inviting artists, poets, carpenters, workers, men of many vocations and avocations. In their association she evolved her designs."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_183 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_184,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_185,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. A Cup of Tea"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fad067020e78dd5fd31ae942ebb526bf"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Nan-in, a Japanese master during the Meiji era (1868-1912) received a university professor who came to inquire about Zen."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1838 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1823,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1839,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1840,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1841,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1842 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "79. Incense Burner"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "cb684e6af336bd3463ddd6d6ce02d307"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Kame was exceedingly slow in creating, but when her work was finished it was always a masterpiece. Her burners were treasured in homes whose womenfolk never drank, smoked, or associated freely with men."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1843 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1823,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1824,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1825,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1844,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1845 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "79. Incense Burner"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b680ef40c107ad75069702940f6095aa"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "The mayor of Nagasaki once requested Kame to design an incense burner for him. She delayed doing so until almost half a year had passed. At that time the mayor, who had been promoted to office in a distant city, visited her. He urged Kame to begin work on his burner."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1846 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1823,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1825,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1847 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "79. Incense Burner"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9cec462164a13d9a00ffb357ab0ff088"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "At last receiving the inspiration, Kame made the incense burner. After it was completed she placed it upon a table. She looked at it long and carefully. She smoked and drank before it as if it were her own company. All day she observed it."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1848 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1823,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1849,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1850 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "79. Incense Burner"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1d1ad665034a77e2b252e2f05cbd11d5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "At last, picking up a hammer, Kame smashed it to bits. She saw it was not the perfect creation her mind demanded."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1851 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1852,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_294,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_506,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_507 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "80.The Real Miracle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8d53eb1505d7826fb6eaa67d441e87c1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "When Bankei was preaching at Ryumon temple, a Shinshu priest, who believed in salvation through the repetition of the name of the Buddha of Love, was jealous of his large audience and wanted to debate with him."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1853 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1854,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1855,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1856,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_294,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_317 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "80.The Real Miracle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2e590ec8a8d2bc59dcf05ac3ca1d193d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Bankei was in the midst of a talk when the priest appeared but the fellow made such a disturbance that Bankei stopped his discourse and asked about the noise."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1857 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1858,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1859,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1860,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1861,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1862,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1863,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1864,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_311 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "80.The Real Miracle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e0162954428cf8d0e18d1a94bf743be0"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "'The founder of our sect,' boasted the priest, 'had such miraculous powers that he held a brush in his hand on one bank of the river, his attendant held up a paper on the other bank, and the teacher wrote the holy name of Amida through the air."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1865 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1866,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "80.The Real Miracle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "bbce63cfd886dd1de952dc35d4a58a69"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Can you do such a wonderful thing?'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1867 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1868,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1869,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1870,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1871,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1872,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_246,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_294,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "80.The Real Miracle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3cee796eb966a511b6b0c59dba1daa66"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Bankei replied lightly: 'Perhaps your fox can perform that trick, but that is not the manner of Zen. My miracle is that when I feel hungry I eat, and when I feel thirsty I drink.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_187 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_184,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_188,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_189,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_190 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. A Cup of Tea"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "721cfb391ba6d0578c00e6e7408fe6bd"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Nan-in saved tea. He poured his visitor's cup full, and then kept on pouring."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1873 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1874,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_630 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "81. Just Go to Sleep"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "416f71ff9a71af730ec6efca07b35d66"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Gasan was sitting at the bedside of Tekisui three days before his teacher's passing. Tekisui had already chosen him as his successor."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1875 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1874,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_391,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_630 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "81. Just Go to Sleep"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1699adbf0a0065a12cbdb0aff2369a5e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "A temple recently had burned and Gasan was busy rebuilding the structure. Tekisui asked him: 'What are you going to do when you get the temple rebuilt?'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1876 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_630 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "81. Just Go to Sleep"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "80d639a47c0321255c4c851738ba47a6"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "'When your sickness is over we want you to speak there,' said Gasan."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1878 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1879,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_370 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "81. Just Go to Sleep"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f87d0fff4ee3a9e00ab3b6376e66d554"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "'Suppose I do not live until then?'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1880 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_630 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "81. Just Go to Sleep"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "dfd9b9181d16bde7557f3bc263472caf"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "'Then we will get someone else,' replied Gasan."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1881 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1874 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "81. Just Go to Sleep"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5e748d54ab9b5057c5b03e4584e08095"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Suppose you cannot find anyone?' continued Tekisui."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1883 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_630 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "81. Just Go to Sleep"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9dd00bfd30815c6422d699e6fc6f72ca"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "Gasan answered loudly: 'Don't ask such foolish questions. Just go to sleep.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1884 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1605,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1885,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1886,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "82. Nothing Exists"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5508959f12f5e72a96ac614bf10e1068"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Yamaoka Tesshu, as a young student of Zen, visited one master after another. He called upon Dokuon of Shokoku."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1887 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1051,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1433,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1888,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1889,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1890,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1891,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1892,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1893,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1894,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_860,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "82. Nothing Exists"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6941437ff59bcb4f3d12a2bce67e5a2a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Desiring to show his attainment, he said: The mind, Buddha, and sentient beings, after all, do not exist. The true nature of phenomena is emptiness. There is no realization, no delusion, no sage, no mediocrity. There is no giving and nothing to be received.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1895 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1612,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1885,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1896 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "82. Nothing Exists"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c516765838a4d288a5dc7bfb12ab0cc4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Dokuon, who was smoking quietly, said nothing. Suddenly he whacked Yamaoka with his bamboo pipe. This made the youth quite angry."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1897 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1885,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_359 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "82. Nothing Exists"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c9e164e0799f39478d061da3b987171a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "'If nothing exists,' inquired Dokuon, 'where did this anger come from?'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1898 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1220,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1900,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1901,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_7 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "83. No Work, No Food"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c9906f981369d893a363d8b85aa161f8"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Hyakujo, the Chinese Zen master, used to labor with his pupils even at the age of eighty, trimming the gardens, cleaning the grounds, and pruning the trees."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1902 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1903,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1904,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_428 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "83. No Work, No Food"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "28e981e0fb727bf72751acb727b5c875"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "The pupils felt sorry to see the old teacher working so hard, but they knew he would not listen to their advice to stop, so they hid away his tools."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1905 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1904,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_333,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_428 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "83. No Work, No Food"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3e2a093bf28ff52ace3773ec7811d49d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "That day the master did not eat. The next day he did not eat, nor the next. 'He may be angry because we have hidden his tools,' the pupils surmised. 'We had better put than back.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1906 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1907,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_312 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "83. No Work, No Food"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "dab6e05ea3ce15e74287bf136f22102b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "The day they did, the teacher worked and ate the same as before. In the evening he instructed them: 'No work no food.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1908 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1909,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1910,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_40,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_594 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "84. True Friends"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9ac6da9ee931e6010add0ec283574d64"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A long time ago in China there were two friends, one who played the harp skillfully and one who listened skillfully."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_191 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_192,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_193,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_194 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. A Cup of Tea"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f70adaffe6381da6e635404e7fc2f05f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "The professor watched the overflow until he no longer could restrain himself. 'It is overfull. No more will go in!'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1911 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1912,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_410,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_537 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "84. True Friends"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b2b8fac6c5f80821458be3ac3fac4657"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "When the one played or sang about a mountain, the other would say: 'I can see the mountain before us.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1913 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1912,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1914,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1915,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_951 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "84. True Friends"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fe23cf310d76bece254e07855360f1be"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "When the one played about water, the listener would exclaim: 'Here is the running stream!'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1916 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1910,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1917,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1918,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1919,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1920,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_594 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "84. True Friends"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "13d66b5dac65651519681512e7f2d0a1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "But the listener fell sick and died. The first friend cut the strings of his harp and never played again. Since that time the cutting of harp strings has always been a sign of intimate friendship."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1921 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1371,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_178,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1922 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "85. Time to Die"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "bf652ebe854f3b389225a50480386213"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Ikkyu, the Zen master, was very clever even as a boy. His teacher had a precious teacup, a rare antique. Ikkyu happened to break this cup and was greatly perplexed. Hearing the footsteps of his teacher, he held the pieces of the cup behind him. When the master appeared, Ikkyu asked: 'Why do people have to die?'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1923 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1924,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1925,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1926,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1927,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1928 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "85. Time to Die"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "de3b6f401d766ffc38922fbddc246e74"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "'This is natural,' explained the older man. 'Everything has to die and has just so long to live.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1929 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1371,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1930 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "85. Time to Die"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3c4e659c9d7fde543b5c555bc213468e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Ikkyu, producing the shattered cup, added: 'It was time for your cup to die.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1931 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1123,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1932,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1933,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_872 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "86. The Living Buddha and the Tubmaker"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1ad223da9c53604f7256e1892e4ff9d7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Zen masters give personal guidance in a secluded room. No one enters while teacher and pupil are together."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1934 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1935,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1936,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1937,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_241,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_428,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_479,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_751 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "86. The Living Buddha and the Tubmaker"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fb9462b16d1d80c6d61e33eded19599b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mokurai, the Zen master of Kennin temple in Kyoto, used to enjoy talking with merchants and newspapermen as well as with his pupils. A certain tubmaker was almost illiterate. He would ask foolish questions of Mokurai have tea, and then go away."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1938 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1937,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1939,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_463,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_479 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "86. The Living Buddha and the Tubmaker"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "574561e23d6108195585139df5b5e5f4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "One day while the tubmaker was there Mokurai wished to give personal guidance to a disciple so he asked the tubmaker to wait in another room."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1940 a neo:Document ;
