        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_223 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "673b54b3ac954a69acaefbfe6cebdcaa"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "'My husband is a gambler and a drunkard,' the housewife told him. 'When he happens to win he drinks and becomes abusive. When he losses he borrows money from others. Sometimes when he becomes thoroughly drunk he does not come home at all. What can I do?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2184 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2185,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3ff18530f6af5a302fe44f77d92ea05f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "by Ekai, called Mumon"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2187 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1380,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2188,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_267,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_7 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. Joshu's Dog"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "89529923da1a80a0776afd45704cf488"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A monk asked Joshu, a Chinese Zen master: \"Has a dog Buddha-nature or not?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2189 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2190,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. Joshu's Dog"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6214ca64b9310ec94495a6b863679617"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Joshu answered: \"Mu.\" *"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2191 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2190,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2192,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2193,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2194,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2195,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_503 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. Joshu's Dog"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7c4a2553b0953a263b073b3af0760b11"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: To realize Zen one has to pass through the barrier of the patriarchs. Enlightenment always comes after the road of thinking is blocked. If you do not pass the barrier of the patriarchs or if your thinking road is not blocked, whatever you think, whatever you do, is like a tangling ghost. You may ask: What is a barrier of a patriarch? This one word, Mu, is it."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2196 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2197,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2198,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. Joshu's Dog"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2db19af90dc41ebdb9c5914c1d11b348"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "This is the barrier of Zen. If you pass through it you will see Joshu face to face. Then you can work hand in hand with the whole line of patriarchs. Is this not a pleasant thing to do?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2199 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2079,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2190,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2200,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2201,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2202,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2203,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2204,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2205,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2206,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_84 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. Joshu's Dog"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8657d4ee860a874654afcfbafa269b3f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "If you want to pass this barrier, you must work through every bone in your body, through every pore of your skin, filled with this question: What is Mu? and carry it day and night. Do not believe it is the common negative symbol meaning nothing. It is not nothingness, the opposite of existence. If you really want to pass this barrier, you should feel like drinking a hot iron ball that you can neither swallow nor spit out."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2207 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1052,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1053,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2208,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2209,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2210,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_524 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. Joshu's Dog"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "40bbf74a5876d9c5017542ac68f99ba4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Then your previous lesser knowledge disappears. As a fruit ripening in season, your subjectivity and objectivity naturally become one. It is like a dumb man who has had a dream. He knows about it but he cannot tell it."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2211 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_13,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1665,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1777,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2212,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2213,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2214,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2215,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2216,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2217,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2218,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. Joshu's Dog"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2070ecd1b5248361fb5694bf36cdc520"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "When he enters this condition his ego-shell is crushed and he can shake the heaven and move the earth. He is like a great warrior with a sharp sword. If a Buddha stands in his way, he will cut him down; if a patriarch offers him any obstacle, he will kill him; and he will be free in his way of birth and death. He can enter any world as if it were his own playground. I will tell you how to do this with this koan:"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2219 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_135,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1888,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2117,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2190,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2220,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2221 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. Joshu's Dog"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "aa35cbc7731b4bb4bb4a9ac0d928b522"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "Just concentrate your whole energy into this Mu, and do not allow any discontinuation. When you enter this Mu and there is no discontinuation, your attainment will be as a candle burning and illuminating the whole universe."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2222 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1380,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1603,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2188,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "1. Joshu's Dog"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e80ad51a04ba932b0f416dd9dcc74c35"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:text "Has a dog Buddha-nature? This is the most serious question of all. If you say yes or no, You lose your own Buddha-nature."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2223 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2224,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2225 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "dae39036ab1563eda5080c37ca703155"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Once when Hyakujo delivered some Zen lectures an old man attended them, unseen by the monks. At the end of each talk when the monks left so did he. But one day he remained after they had gone, and Hyakujo asked him: \"Who are you?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2226 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1868,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2224,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2227,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2228,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2229,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2230,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2231,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_410,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_633,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_639 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "769388f22d8dfde3b4bcd7cabfdb4ada"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "The old man replied: \"I am not a human being, but I was a human being when the Kashapa Buddha preached in this world. I was a Zen master and lived on this mountain. At that time one of my students asked me whether or not the enlightened man is subject to the law of causation. I answered him: 'The enlightened man is not subject to the law of causation.' For this answer evidencing a clinging to absoluteness I became a fox for five hundred rebirths, and I am still a fox. Will you save me from this condition with your Zen words and let me get out of a fox's body? Now may I ask you: Is the enlightened man subject to the law of causation?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2232 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1531,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2233 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "98ac9778061c173fbbe2d9855085a34f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Hyakujo said: \"The enlightened man is one with the law of causation.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2234 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1222,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1868,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2235,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_410 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6239811bda4fbe4c73a412f8f707e6e4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "At the words of Hyakujo the old man was enlightened. \"I am emancipated,\" he said, paying homage with a deep bow. \"I am no more a fox, but I have to leave my body in my dwelling place behind this mountain. Please perform my funeral as a monk.\" Then he disappeared."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2236 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2237,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2238,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "29204e8dc2b8ab7c1eb6af01ad2924b1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "The next day Hyakujo gave an order through the chief monk to prepare to attend the funeral of a monk. \"No one was sick in the infirmary,\" wondered the monks. \"What does our teacher mean?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2239 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2240,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2241,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2242,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2243,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_410,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_608 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7fee541ae7ee9f1d8b0f2121f3bd8480"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "After dinner Hyakujo led the monks out and around the mountain. In a cave, with his staff he poked out the corpse of an old fox and then performed the ceremony of cremation."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_224 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_199,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_225,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_226,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_227 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9d8ebaadba0ebb786cc3cee57c47056f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "'I will help him,' said Gudo. 'Here is some money. Get me a gallon of fine wine and something good to eat. Then you may retire. I will meditate before the shrine.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2244 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_180,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1854,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2228 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ed0a8e463d350bd3ffdacbfbdd4e7104"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "That evening Hyakujo gave a talk to the monks and told them this story about the law of causation."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2245 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1868,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2246,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2247,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2248,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2249,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2250 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1ff47211a6f23cbca10aee552ce9e77d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "Obaku, upon hearing the story, asked Hyakujo: \"I understand that a long time ago because a certain person gave a wrong Zen answer he became a fox for five hundred rebirths. Now I want to ask: If some modern master is asked many questions and he always gives the right answer, what will become of him?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2251 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2246 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8caca835b2a7ca0fee0d0449d31f3858"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:text "Hyakujo said: \"You come here near me and I will tell you.\" Obaku went near Hyakujo and slapped the teacher's face with his hand, for he knew this was the answer his teacher intended to give him."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2252 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2253,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2254 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7945be8a894e31e5c964fa4230fa8d57"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:text "Hyakujo clapped his hands and laughed at this discernment. \"I thought a Persian had a red beard,\" he said, \"and now I know a Persian who has a red beard.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2255 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1531,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1868,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_347 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "14499e52fd6ba4fb932d0929047fbcd1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: \"The enlightened man is not subject.\" How can this answer make the monk a fox?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2256 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1531,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2233,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2257 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "72561f03350dfd5e88edf9afb5ad0d4b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:text "\"The enlightened man is one with the law of causation.\" How can this answer make the fox emancipated?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2258 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2259,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2260 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "cc4fe3215e2303b859858dfa6aa6a4ba"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 13 ;
    neo:text "To understand this clearly one has to have just one eye."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2261 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2262,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2263,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2264,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2265,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2266 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Hyakujo's Fox"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "085461c9efde04219a9a926ea993ff29"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 14 ;
    neo:text "Controlled or not controlled? The same dice shows two faces. Not controlled or controlled, Both are a grievous error."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2267 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2268,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2269,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Gutei's Finger"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "412792e4ded541290031c901bba0db80"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Gutei raised his finger whenever he was asked a question about Zen. A boy attendant began to imitate him in this way. When anyone asked the boy what his master had preached about, the boy would raise his finger."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2270 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2268,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2271,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2272,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2273,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_503 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Gutei's Finger"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a7bc153039f04155b9132a98ac3c38d5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Gutei heard about the boy's mischief. He seized him and cut off his finger. The boy cried and ran away. Gutei called and stopped him. When the boy turned his head to Gutei, Gutei raised up his own finger. In that instant the boy was enlightened."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2274 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2268,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2275,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2276 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Gutei's Finger"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1f139a5aa5238da886555c54932449c4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "When Gutei was about to pass from this world he gathered his monks around him. \"I attained my finger-Zen,\" he said, \"from my teacher Tenryu, and in my whole life I could not exhaust it.\" Then he passed away."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2277 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2268,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2271,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2273,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2275,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2278,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_503 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Gutei's Finger"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "58056eb30c164e15a40772f3726a6b95"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Enlightenment, which Gutei and the boy attained, has nothing to do with a finger. If anyone clings to a finger, Tenryu will be so disappointed that he will annihilate Gutei, the boy, and the clinger all together."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2279 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2268,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2271,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2275,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2280,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2281,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2282,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_251 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Gutei's Finger"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9d2063a8dcaffa2668457216870f6db4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Gutei cheapens the teaching of Tenryu, Emancipating the boy with a knife. Compared to the Chinese god who pushed aside a mountain with one"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_228 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_229,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_230 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f330793ed343d5c7f4b0b11b092b8748"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "When the man of the house returned about midnight, quite drunk; he bellowed: 'Hey, wife I am home. Have you something for me eat?'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2283 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2284,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2285 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Gutei's Finger"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "380073d6aa160786cb87e365794cf3f9"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "hand Old Gutei is a poor imitator."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2286 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2287,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2288,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_39 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "4. A Beardless Foreigner"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "cd6800f045ec3547c0796fe9392b295d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Wakuan complained when he saw a picture of bearded Bodhidharma: \"Why hasn't that fellow a beard?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2289 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1890,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2290,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_39,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_748 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "4. A Beardless Foreigner"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "49e67aff4de3ed159494d53f4be3863e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: If you want to study Zen, you must study it with your heart. When you attain realization, it must be true realization. You yourself must have the face of the great Bodhidharma to see him. Just one such glimpse will be enough. But if you say you met him, you never saw him at all."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2291 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2210,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2288,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2292,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_39 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "4. A Beardless Foreigner"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "be1224d26572859d4e0fdabc7d995961"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "One should not discuss a dream In front of a simpleton. Why has Bodhidharma no beard? What an absurd question!"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2293 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2294,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_30,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_39,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_40 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "5. Kyogen Mounts the Tree"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "64b8e716d9645411790d96e1a7dfbc3a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Kyogen said: \"Zen is like a man hanging in a tree by his teeth over a precipice. His hands grasp no branch, his feet rest on no limb, and under the tree another person asks him: 'Why did Bodhidharma come to China from India?'\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2295 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2296,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2297,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2298,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2299,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2300,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2301 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "5. Kyogen Mounts the Tree"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f716159c843645fb4d95be6feca2eb15"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "If the man in the tree does not answer, he fails; and if he does answer, he falls and loses his life. Now what shall he do?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_23 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_24,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_25,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_26,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_27,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_28,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_29,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_30,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_32 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Foreword"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3b93c397d7fb934a8866abc5c96ba171"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Centering, a transcription of ancient Sanskrit manuscripts, first appeared in the Spring 1955 issue of Gentry magazine, New York. It presents in ancient teaching, still alive in Kashmir and parts of India after more than four thousand years that may well be the roots of Zen."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2302 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2303,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_297,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "5. Kyogen Mounts the Tree"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "495bc2c21484edd07643ea3524e609c0"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: In such a predicament the most talented eloquence is of no use. If you have memorized all the sutras, you cannot use them. When you can give the right answer, even though your past road was one of death, you open up a new road of life. But if you cannot answer, you should live ages hence and ask the future Buddha, Maitreya."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2304 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1204,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1773,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2294,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2305,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2306,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_428 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "5. Kyogen Mounts the Tree"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "77774904cca9f72bd74845d928d7bbe4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Kyogen is truly a fool Spreading that ego-killing poison That closes his pupils' mouths And lets their tears stream from their dead eyes."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2307 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_168,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2308,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2309,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "6. Buddha Twirls a Flower"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "de0a4b35a64a83b42080c943a76163b8"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "When Buddha was in Grdhrakuta mountain he turned a flower in his fingers and held it before his listeners. Every one was silent. Only Maha-Kashapa smiled at this revelation, although he tried to control the lines of his face."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_231 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_199,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_226,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_230,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_232,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_233 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b99692287486e3001750fca25c38af43"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "I have something for you: said Gudo. 'I happened to be caught in the rain and your wife kindly asked me to remain here for the night. In return I have bought some wine and fish. You might as well have them.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2310 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1641,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2178,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2309,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2311,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2312,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_251,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_87,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "6. Buddha Twirls a Flower"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7388f91e42d7730d4f47173467c1bdc4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Buddha said: \"I have the eye of the true teaching, the heart of Nirvana, the true aspect of non-form, and the ineffable stride of Dharma. It is not expressed by words, but especially transmitted beyond teaching. This teaching I have given to Maha-Kashapa.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2313 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1890,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2309,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2314,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2315 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "6. Buddha Twirls a Flower"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fbafba6d65941642a6e8edaa20034d4c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Golden-faced Gautama thought he could cheat anyone. He made the good listeners as bad, and sold dog meat under the sign of mutton. And he himself thought it was wonderful. What if all the audience had laughed together? How could he have transmitted the teaching? And again, if Maha-Kashapa had not smiled, how could he have transmitted the teaching? If he says that realization can be transmitted, he is like the city slicker that cheats the country dub, and if he says it cannot be transmitted, why does he approve of Maha-Kashapa?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2316 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_168,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1777,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2214,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2309,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2317 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "6. Buddha Twirls a Flower"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "76ce206155febd281b7ab981e1deb533"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "At the turning of a flower His disguise was exposed. No one in heaven or earth can surpass Maha-Kashapa's wrinkled face."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2318 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2319,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "7. Joshu Washes the Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b0d81a5f7cb9f0e8afcb32c35173992c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A monk told Joshu: \"I have just entered the monastery. Please teach me.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2320 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2321,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "7. Joshu Washes the Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "07a3797ab68ee09bea99ded55235378a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Joshu asked: \"Have you eaten your rice porridge?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2322 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_347 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "7. Joshu Washes the Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7fcdc45641146b4a4cee1900f4245cc2"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "The monk replied: \"I have eaten.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2323 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1032,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "7. Joshu Washes the Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d5942482bb97fef4170898ccb1a8052c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Joshu said: \"Then you had better wash your bowl.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2324 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_347,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_943 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "7. Joshu Washes the Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "64f7b36a7e8cc27496178441edd12968"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "At that moment the monk was enlightened."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2325 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2326,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2327,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "7. Joshu Washes the Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0b40c7d230007949b36067503fc6697d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Joshu is the man who opens his mouth and shows his heart. I doubt if this monk really saw Joshu's heart. I hope he did not mistake the bell for a pitcher."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2328 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1744,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2030,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2106,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2329 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "7. Joshu Washes the Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e448815083d442b9062c3e9f5c9f9b58"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "It is too clear and so it is hard to see. A dunce once searched for a fire with a lighted lantern. Had he known what fire was, He could have cooked his rice much sooner."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2330 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1033,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2331,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2332,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2333,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2334,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_40,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_969 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "8. Keichu's Wheel"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c126a589efbdb208627705ca613ef99d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Getsuan said to his students: \"Keichu, the first wheel-maker of China, made two wheels of fifty spokes each. Now, suppose you removed the nave uniting the spokes. What would become of the wheel? And had Keichu done this, could he be called the master wheel-maker?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2335 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1322,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1603,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2336,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2337,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "8. Keichu's Wheel"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "59996acd2bc8159cce537001360288de"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: If anyone can answer this question instantly, his eyes will be like a comet and his mind like a flash of lightning."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2338 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1777,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2214,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2339,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2341,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2342,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_333,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_878 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "8. Keichu's Wheel"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9950c268bef6c2238a409c52c56df3d5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "When the hubless wheel turns, Master or no master can stop it. It turns above heaven and below earth, South, north, east, and west."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_234 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_199,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_226,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_235,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_236,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_237 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "51342b90f7294a453ce700d63d78fa47"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "The man was delighted. He drank the wine at once and laid himself down on the floor. Gudo sat in mediation beside him."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2343 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_139,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2344,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2345,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2346,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2347,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "9. A Buddha before History"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d9b1e78d31b838b4e542cb8f77fcee66"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A monk asked Seijo: \"I understand that a Buddha who lived before recorded history sat in meditation for ten cycles of existence and could not realize the highest truth, and so could not become fully emancipated. Why was this so?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2348 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2344,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2349 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "9. A Buddha before History"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "237951ff565806d48f8920094b34fdc7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Seijo replied: \"Your question is self-explanatory.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2350 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2351,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2352,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_347,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_650 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "9. A Buddha before History"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "da3c5ef26dff5dd578c3a34a2fe24d12"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "The monk asked: \"Since the Buddha was meditating, why could he not fulfill Buddhahood?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2353 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2344,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "9. A Buddha before History"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9e8d3fc569bca62119bb1be51819e1df"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Seijo said: \"He was not a Buddha.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2354 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_151,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1890,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2355,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2356 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "9. A Buddha before History"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a5b99d79d67bba4863ef5868de8d07b4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: I will allow his realization, but I will not admit his understanding. When one ignorant attains realization he is a saint. When a saint begins to understand he is ignorant."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2357 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2204,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2358,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2359,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_697,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "9. A Buddha before History"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "745157f8f91ea22b44baf9b50291621b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "It is better to realize mind than body. When mind is realized one need not worry about body. When mind and body become one The man is free. Then he desires no praising."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2360 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1610,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1664,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1766,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2361,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2362,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. Seizei Alone and Poor"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "cd94704ca4bb5484fd52525e850a1758"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A monk named Seizei asked of Sozan: \"Seizei is alone and poor. Will you give him support?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2363 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1664,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2361 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. Seizei Alone and Poor"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4f9c093ac8672f6ccfb315cea94a4745"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Sozan asked: \"Seizei?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2364 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2361 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. Seizei Alone and Poor"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a21178b9749664479e2081297d72b821"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Seizei responded: \"Yes, sir.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2366 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1664,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_40 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. Seizei Alone and Poor"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1e5ebacd9c5bf01aafe3904a0456da6d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Sozan said: \"You have Zen, the best wine in China, and already have finished three cups, and still you are saying that they did not even wet your lips.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2367 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1664,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_226,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2361 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. Seizei Alone and Poor"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e75b687ff3ff23ec0854aa653bf243e9"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Seizei overplayed his hand. Why was it so? Because Sozan had eyes and knew with whom to deal. Even so, I want to ask: At what point did Seizei drink wine?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2368 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2369,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2370,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_40 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. Seizei Alone and Poor"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e81dbe1c37d848a9bfac609af8b61e3c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "The poorest man in China, The bravest man in China, He barely sustains himself, Yet wishes to rival the wealthiest."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2371 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2372,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "11. Joshu Examines a Monk in Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5ffdafd75b84834d5217ef815b2fe0fb"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Joshu went to a place where a monk had retired to meditate and asked him: \"What is, is what?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2373 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1020,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_347 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "11. Joshu Examines a Monk in Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "04b7850c5736f022e632b726bc1e8848"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "The monk raised his fist."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2374 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2375,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_951 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "11. Joshu Examines a Monk in Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8cd56376c02719964b7079453de04b3c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Joshu replied: \"Ships cannot remain where the water is too shallow.\" And he left."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2376 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_347,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "11. Joshu Examines a Monk in Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "18047dac6ccf8b6f12719e45899b78b7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "A few days later Joshu went again to visit the monk and asked the same question."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2377 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_347 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "11. Joshu Examines a Monk in Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "122e33aee2979f5ae2a02c5dd3422ca4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "The monk answered the same way."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2378 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "11. Joshu Examines a Monk in Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "16f2dd137a248d029c87d2c79bad0e95"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Joshu said: \"Well given, well taken, well killed, well saved.\" And he bowed to the monk."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2379 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2380,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2381,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2382,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "11. Joshu Examines a Monk in Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ff135eab7208ed6b788511c0898060a0"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: The raised fist was the same both times. Why is it Joshu did not admit the first and approved the second one? Where is the fault?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_238 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_199,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_239 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b01ad2dd086ccaeb951b6a94b06f0a5b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:text "In the morning when the husband awoke he had forgotten about the previous night. 'Who are you? Where do yon come from?' he asked Gudo, who still was meditating."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2383 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2205,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2384,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "11. Joshu Examines a Monk in Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "860be38f9c042f4b2cb87d036efcaffd"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "Whoever answers this knows that Joshu's tongue has no bone so he can use it freely. Yet perhaps Joshu is wrong. Or, through that monk, he may have discovered his mistake."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2385 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1322,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_155,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1912,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2386,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_537 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "11. Joshu Examines a Monk in Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e9b75d85b241d20702303064dac50978"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:text "If anyone thinks that the one's insight exceeds the other's, he has no eyes."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2387 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1178,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2336,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2388,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2389,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2390,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_697 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "11. Joshu Examines a Monk in Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f351b20ba42bc44e2b2c7e7a06723091"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:text "The light of the eyes is as a comet, And Zen's activity is as lightning. The sword that kills the man Is the sword that saves the man."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2391 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2392,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_333 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "12. Zuigan Calls His Own Master"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a27ba60b267f27ac74ac17f1920e5c4f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Zuigan called out to himself every day: \"Master.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2393 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2365,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "12. Zuigan Calls His Own Master"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d57041ef57eab0428e342061ae6cacfc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Then he answered himself: \"Yes, sir.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2394 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2395,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "12. Zuigan Calls His Own Master"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "39910d3991793a18f993837309eff607"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "And after that he added: \"Become sober.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2396 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_456 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "12. Zuigan Calls His Own Master"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b5266be313bf5033663ae56b831a8fbc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Again he answered: \"Yes, sir.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2397 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_530 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "12. Zuigan Calls His Own Master"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c08ea01287e6fa0db0f255e1e33573cd"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "\"And after that,\" he continued, \"do not be deceived by others.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2398 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_456 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "12. Zuigan Calls His Own Master"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1785baf3d84aa0a55a7d73f9f608ddb2"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "\"Yes, sir; yes, sir,\" he answered."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2399 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1868,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2392,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2400,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2401,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_333 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "12. Zuigan Calls His Own Master"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7d2c8334922267aa9caab9096e357e9c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Old Zuigan sells out and buys himself. He is opening a puppet show. He uses one mask to call \"Master\" and another that answers the master. Another mask says \"Sober up\" and another, \"Do not be cheated by others.\" If anyone clings to any of his masks, he is mistaken, yet if he imitates Zuigan, he will make himself fox-like."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_240 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_199,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_201,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_235,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_241,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_242 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "59e03090ab630a117c28b8a49f71de88"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:text "'I am Gudo of Kyoto and I am going on to Edo,' replied the Zen master. The man was utterly ashamed. He apologized profusely to the teacher of his emperor."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2404 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2218,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2405,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2406,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2407,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_295 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "12. Zuigan Calls His Own Master"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e7e89ec2c44caf5c71929025d9ccd96c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "Some Zen students do not realize the true man in a mask Because they recognize ego-soul. Ego-soul is the seed of birth and death, And foolish people call it the true man."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2408 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1032,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2410,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2411,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2412,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_436 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "13. Tokusan Holds His Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "97357e81465e4ac7b5c34cad4c2ec3f5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Tokusan went to the dining room from the meditation hall holding his bowl. Seppo was on duty cooking. When he met Tokusan he said: \"The dinner drum is not yet beaten. Where are you going with your bowl?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2413 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_771 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "13. Tokusan Holds His Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e221f47e0f63deac57fe682518becd30"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "So Tokusan returned to his room."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2414 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2410,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2415,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2416 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "13. Tokusan Holds His Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c21ce8ee5e0793399ed5833d8276fa4c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Seppo told Ganto about this. Ganto said: \"Old Tokusan did not understand ultimate truth.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2417 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2415,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "13. Tokusan Holds His Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c42af302260d84b354adea4c9f1cf2ed"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Tokusan heard of this remark and asked Ganto to come to him. \"I have heard,\" he said, \"you are not approving my Zen.\" Ganto admitted this indirectly. Tokusan said nothing."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2418 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2415,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_40 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "13. Tokusan Holds His Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "14f09aae88b0162a4f50d40c13eb61e4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "The next day Tokusan delivered an entirely different kind of lecture to the monks. Ganto laughed and clapped his hands, saying: \"I see our old man understands ultimate truth indeed. None in China can surpass him.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2419 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2415,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2416 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "13. Tokusan Holds His Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0dd9fdc8ca4fb309e00f92f0ec117cd1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Speaking about ultimate truth, both Ganto and Tokusan did not even dream it. After all, they are dummies."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2420 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2416,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2421,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2422,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2423 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "13. Tokusan Holds His Bowl"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "de1427db17e2c4883d9f1a477679677c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "Whoever understands the first truth Should understand the ultimate truth. The last and first, Are they not the same?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2424 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2426,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2427,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2428 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "14. Nansen Cuts the Cat in Two"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "58a53e15b146654d8f275046e866b47f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Nansen saw the monks of the eastern and western halls fighting over a cat. He seized the cat and told the monks: \"If any of you say a good word, you can save the cat.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2429 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2428 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "14. Nansen Cuts the Cat in Two"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4b8c030989c2e54732d4a21f3b62160c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "No one answered. So Nansen boldly cut the cat in two pieces."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_243 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_169,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_199,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_244,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_245,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_246,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_247,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_248 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "142ad977a42ee4700d05d220cfbd4e72"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:text "Gudo smiled. 'Everything in this life is impermanent' he explained. 'Life is very brief. If you keep on gambling and drinking yon will have no time left to accomplish anything else, and you will cause your family to suffer too.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2430 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_211,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "14. Nansen Cuts the Cat in Two"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5764c6e7d2b56267ce4bc6d05024229d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "That evening Joshu returned and Nansen told him about this. Joshu removed his sandals and, placing them on his head, walked out."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2431 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2428 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "14. Nansen Cuts the Cat in Two"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2de67f323c8708c1da66df69b4e8f269"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Nansen said: \"If you had been there, you could have saved the cat.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2432 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1548,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_211,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2433,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "14. Nansen Cuts the Cat in Two"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a9fb8227a737508dd24cc079750a251d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Why did Joshu put his sandals on his head? If anyone answers this question, he will understand exactly how Nansen enforced the edict. If not, he should watch his own head."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2434 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1178,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2433,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "14. Nansen Cuts the Cat in Two"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f95458151bd457bcb72eed42185f4a15"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Had Joshu been there, He would have enforced the edict oppositely. Joshu snatches the sword And Nansen begs for his life."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2435 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2bcc319630004e50f56f2e595c85bb43"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Tozan went to Ummon. Ummon asked him where he had come from."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2438 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2439 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7044e7b75e3d3ce21864585a6502e384"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Tozan said: \"From Sato village.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2440 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2441,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_391 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fe66a95e72d8feb093e87d19eda49c9b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Ummon asked: \"In what temple did you remain for the summer?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2442 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2443,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2444,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2445 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9d198fcebde317cf979f1ae1fc63151c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Tozan replied: \"The temple of Hoji, south of the lake.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2446 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f376a3c12f33b22989ebeb7b7f9aaa8d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "\"When did you leave there?\" asked Ummon, wondering how long Tozan would continue with such factual answers."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2447 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2448 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a21f602876a90b13282767642c668a79"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "\"The twenty-fifth of August,\" answered Tozan."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2449 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1707,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "86358088fea6487b1f7a86e016beece7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "Ummon said: \"I should give you three blows with a stick, but today I forgive you.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2450 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1f48300156be6be34fd7f2c05b16690b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "The next day Tozan bowed to Ummon and asked: \"Yesterday you forgave me three blows. I do not know why you thought me wrong.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2451 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2319,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9a3740ef3a4e338c5154d63f043ee53b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:text "Ummon, rebuking Tozan's spiritless responses, said: \"You are good for nothing. You simply wander from one monastery to another.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2452 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b4e381ffed469d90958f4c9dd09b783b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:text "Before Ummon's words were ended Tozan was enlightened."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2453 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2454,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_247 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "494f2c745783b1f35d485e19867d3bdc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Ummon fed Tozan good Zen food. If Tozan can digest it, Ummon may add another member to his family."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2455 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fbde027deca35556ffa581c839288e0f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:text "In the evening Tozan swam around in a sea of good and bad, but at dawn Ummon crushed his nut shell. After all, he wasn't so smart."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2456 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2457,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_587 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f9e8ebef707b5d47cd7a9870cf9fc1b1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 13 ;
    neo:text "Now, I want to ask: Did Tozan deserve the three blows? If you say yes, not only Tozan but every one of you deserves them. If you say no, Ummon is speaking a lie. If you answer this question clearly, you can eat the same food as Tozan."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2458 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2436,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2459,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2460 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "15. Tozan's Three Blows"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2d2990fe9f07257c6ea807374ef2d661"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 14 ;
    neo:text "The lioness teaches her cubs roughly; The cubs jump and she knocks them down. When Ummon saw Tozan his first arrow was light; His second arrow shot deep."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2461 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1665,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2326,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2462 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "16. Bells and Robes"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3afc3220e30e98a3c7f6c90c256f54ac"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Ummon asked: \"The world is such a wide world, why do you answer a bell and don ceremonial robes?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2464 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_155,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2082,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2083,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2465,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2466,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_47,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_768,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_928 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "16. Bells and Robes"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5cc8a8422b8a1cfa66f5ff243024dbdc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: When one studies Zen one need not follow sound or color or form. Even though some have attained insight when hearing a voice or seeing a color or a form, this is a very common way. It is not true Zen. The real Zen student controls sound, color, form, and actualizes the truth in his everyday life."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2467 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_151,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2468,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2469,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2470,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2471,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_768 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "16. Bells and Robes"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b558d2592ac3dc9e1a5730a372e4bac1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Sound comes to the ear, the ear goes to sound. When you blot out sound and sense, what do you understand? While listening with ears one never can understand. To understand intimately one should see sound."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2472 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_247,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2473,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2474,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2475,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_923 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "16. Bells and Robes"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d2fc072100c4c874b1f15f7abffe276c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "When you understand, you belong to the family; When you do not understand, you are a stranger. Those who do not understand belong to the family, And when they understand they are strangers."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2476 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_200,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2477,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2478 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "17. The Three Calls of the Emperor's Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "819a7e2d0ee5a35b0f17c2ad1cc50895"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Chu, called Kokushi, the teacher of the emperor, called to his attendant: \"Oshin.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2479 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2478 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "17. The Three Calls of the Emperor's Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "58d0b2c7768170ef4de569956fbabaeb"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Oshin answered: \"Yes.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2481 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2477,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2478,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_872 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "17. The Three Calls of the Emperor's Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9340fc39e70fedca508e9a8dc7ca1157"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Chu repeated, to test his pupil: \"Oshin.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2482 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2478 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "17. The Three Calls of the Emperor's Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d32ecba404a95f14fe02afb90d676523"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Oshin repeated: \"Yes.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2483 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2477,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2478 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "17. The Three Calls of the Emperor's Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1192bec05bf71d8875baedd61b41dc28"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Chu called: \"Oshin.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2484 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2477,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "17. The Three Calls of the Emperor's Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "906ff46d8c09e3b93995f494eea90b30"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "Chu said: \"I ought to apologize to you for all this calling, but really you ought to apologize to me.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2485 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2477,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2478,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2486,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2487 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "17. The Three Calls of the Emperor's Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "024e91134d81770354458d5a46a61933"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: When old Chu called Oshin three times his tongue was rotting, but when Oshin answered three times his words were brilliant. Chu was getting decrepit and lonesome, and his method of teaching was like holding a cow's head to feed it clover."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2488 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1082,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2478,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_526,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_603 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "17. The Three Calls of the Emperor's Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e87443cd526de9245baf790f1e36718c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:text "Oshin did not trouble to show his Zen either. His satisfied stomach had no desire to feast. When the country is prosperous everyone is indolent; when the home is wealthy the children are spoiled."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2489 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_370 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "17. The Three Calls of the Emperor's Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b40b5901d24c65404f9b09b1a2bac632"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:text "Now I want to ask you: Which one should apologize?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_249 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_239,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_250,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_251,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_252 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "54b90749f5cc0b50c17203d5f500dbc3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:text "The perception of the husband awoke as if from a dream. 'You are right,' he declared. 'How can I ever repay you for this wonderful teaching! Let me see you off and carry your things a little way.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2490 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1548,
