    neo:h3 "19. Everyday Life Is the Path"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "22839fe8a6f577b11714ef09f1a13e43"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "At these words Joshu was enlightened."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2527 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "19. Everyday Life Is the Path"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0a0603ad58334c76f65b7ffd6ff22278"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Nansen could melt Joshu's frozen doubts at once when Joshu asked his questions. I doubt though if Joshu reached the point that Nansen did. He needed thirty more years of study."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2528 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1323,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2441,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2529,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2530,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2531,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2532,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2533,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_351,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_400,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_433,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "19. Everyday Life Is the Path"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d27af4c3ca1c6a474d15f64955f115ac"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:text "In spring, hundreds of flowers; in autumn, a harvest moon; In summer, a refreshing breeze; in winter, snow will accompany you. If useless things do not hang in your mind, Any season is a good season for you."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_253 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_199,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_254 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "294500691601ac826926f4d1ef06cf2b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 13 ;
    neo:text "'If you wish,' assented Gudo. The two started out. After they had gone three miles Gudo told him to return. 'Just another five miles,' he begged Gudo. They continued on."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2534 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2384,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2535,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_639,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_822 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "20. The Enlightened Man"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f420a2ad44c337b5fb82924a6dcae467"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Shogen asked: \"Why does the enlightened man not stand on his feet and explain himself?\" And he also said: \"It is not necessary for speech to come from the tongue.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2536 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1069,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1744,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2535,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2537 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "20. The Enlightened Man"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "434682bdb8aeff1f77a794de7561a85c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Shogen spoke plainly enough, but how many will understand? If anyone comprehends, he should come to my place and test out my big stick. Why, look here, to test real gold you must see it through fire."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2538 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1548,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2204,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2539,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2540,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2541,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_462,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_503 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "20. The Enlightened Man"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3c22e5fabe2ba4fbf9bfd4234c50a431"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "If the feet of enlightenment moved, the great ocean would overflow; If that head bowed, it would look down upon the heavens. Such a body has no place to rest... Let another continue this poem."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2542 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "21. Dried Dung"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2dd1c79b26b4ffe1f4a221970ff14cbf"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A monk asked Ummon: \"What is Buddha?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2543 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_220,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2544 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "21. Dried Dung"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "aee29680d7a61c041172085b2decc975"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Ummon answered him: \"Dried dung.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2545 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_251,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2544,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2546,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_587,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_719 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "21. Dried Dung"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2230c24f318451d918492b1207666df5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: It seems to me Ummon is so poor he cannot distinguish the taste of one food from another, or else he is too busy to write readable letters. Well, he tried to hold his school with dried dung. And his teaching was just as useless."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2547 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1322,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2390,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2548,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "21. Dried Dung"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7611845fd383f86f0de85deba584fd20"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Lightning flashes, Sparks shower. In one blink of your eyes You have missed seeing."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2549 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2550,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2551,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_54,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "22. Kashapa's Preaching Sign"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3e966e4d401bdd86cfaa3089e7b8049a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Ananda asked Kashapa: \"Buddha gave you the golden-woven robe of successorship. What else did he give you?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_255 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_199 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fd9b8f79b591c335b4c3a66d70c5b3da"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 14 ;
    neo:text "You may return now,' suggested Gudo."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2552 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2550,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_54 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "22. Kashapa's Preaching Sign"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b92483e2f7b6b56376c654e4c2180493"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Kashapa said: \"Ananda.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2553 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_54,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_550 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "22. Kashapa's Preaching Sign"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "34f4d7be9aa3a0d60634e3a005b7179a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Ananda answered: \"Yes, brother.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2554 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2550,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2555 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "22. Kashapa's Preaching Sign"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "857da40e15c284a02d90cfea270314d3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Said Kashapa: \"Now you can take down my preaching sign and put up your own.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2556 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_151,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2557,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2558,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_47,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_503 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "22. Kashapa's Preaching Sign"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4e9a767903358970d762eec37a86db73"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: If one understands this, he will see the old brotherhood still gathering, but if not, even though he has studied the truth from ages before the Buddhas, he will not attain enlightenment."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2559 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2529,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2560,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_895,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_896 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "22. Kashapa's Preaching Sign"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9d0f3687b5733f0c8fbfa52eec5298e7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "The point of the question is dull but the answer is intimate. How many persons hearing it will open their eyes? Elder brother calls and younger brother answers, This spring does not belong to the ordinary season."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2561 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2351,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2562,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2563,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2564,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2565 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "23. Do Not Think Good, Do Not Think Not-Good"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a3347414bb174f06939daa52921870fa"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "When he became emancipated the sixth patriarch received from the fifth patriarch the bowl and robe given from the Buddha to his successors, generation after generation."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2566 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1031,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1032,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1747,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2567,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2568,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2569 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "23. Do Not Think Good, Do Not Think Not-Good"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3003c4d6a8aff6f743ba57eb5332b986"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "A monk named E-myo out of envy pursued the patriarch to take this great treasure away from him. The sixth patriarch placed the bowl and robe on a stone in the road and told E-myo: \"These objects just symbolize the faith. There is no use fighting over them. If you desire to take them, take them now.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_257 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_235,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_258 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9b766c123063e2a16c155c27da328b49"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 15 ;
    neo:text "'After another ten miles,' the man replied."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2570 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1031,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1032,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_251,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2567,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2571 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "23. Do Not Think Good, Do Not Think Not-Good"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "919ee68987bfe1e7339cf3c96d2e141f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "When E-myo went to move the bowl and robe they were as heavy as mountains. He could not budge them. Trembling for shame he said: \"I came wanting the teaching, not the material treasures. Please teach me.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2572 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2523,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2524,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2562,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2573 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "23. Do Not Think Good, Do Not Think Not-Good"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4a4ea2bcba56c4b812971716f363c6bd"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "The sixth patriarch said: \"When you do not think good and when you do not think not-good, what is your true self?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2574 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_251,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2567,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2575 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "23. Do Not Think Good, Do Not Think Not-Good"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2308f3788bf954a7c2093aa7e89911fa"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "At these words E-myo was illumined. Perspiration broke out all over his body. He cried and bowed, saying: \"You have given me the secret words and meanings. Is there yet a deeper part of the teaching?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2576 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2562,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2573,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2577,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "23. Do Not Think Good, Do Not Think Not-Good"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c4721923b9cc687cf810391d460dd292"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "The sixth patriarch replied: \"What I have told you is no secret at all. When you realize your own true self the secret belongs to you.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2578 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2567,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2579 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "23. Do Not Think Good, Do Not Think Not-Good"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8be54598b2d6f484c1c88da6a7587499"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "E-myo said: \"I was under the fifth patriarch many years but could not realize my true self until now. Through your teaching I find the source. A person drinks water and knows himself whether it is cold or warm. May I call you my teacher?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2580 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2568,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2579 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "23. Do Not Think Good, Do Not Think Not-Good"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d1843dabf2331e9886e85de895fd929e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "The sixth patriarch replied: \"We studied together under the fifth patriarch. Call him your teacher, but just treasure what you have attained.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2581 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2568,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2582,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2583,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_524,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_84,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_872 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "23. Do Not Think Good, Do Not Think Not-Good"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "781530877010fe74c50d0668467d0cbc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: The sixth patriarch certainly was kind in such an emergency. It was as if he removed the skin and seeds from the fruit and then, opening the pupil's mouth, let him eat."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2584 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2573,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "23. Do Not Think Good, Do Not Think Not-Good"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c796f8e5f27ae2da7bbd2534451aef06"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:text "You cannot describe it, you cannot picture it, You cannot admire it, you cannot sense it. It is your true self, it has nowhere to hide."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2585 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1670,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2586 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "23. Do Not Think Good, Do Not Think Not-Good"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d674c9c81798d5a13f82a3224128ce31"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:text "When the world is destroyed, it will not be destroyed."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2587 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2588,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "24. Without Words, Without Silence"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e2e3efdce16456092a19381a89cb4fed"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A monk asked Fuketsu: \"Without speaking, without silence, how can you express the truth?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2589 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2588,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2590,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2591,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2592,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2593 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "24. Without Words, Without Silence"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ffed5675dced886dc3a90a8618115216"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Fuketsu observed: \"I always remember springtime in southern China. The birds sing among innumerable kinds of fragrant flowers.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_259 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_199,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_258 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d2104b3175ed2f4436e61e426a17c049"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 16 ;
    neo:text "'Return now,' said Gudo, when the ten miles had been passed."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2594 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2588,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2595,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2596,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_47,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_87,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_899 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "24. Without Words, Without Silence"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "09c0cf4f4a85326105c9d4ccdf21baaa"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Fuketsu used to have lightning Zen. Whenever he had the opportunity, he flashed it. But this time he failed to do so and only borrowed from an old Chinese poem. Never mind Fuketsu's Zen. If you want to express the truth, throw out your words, throw out your silence, and tell me about your own Zen."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2597 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1760,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2598,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2599,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2600,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "24. Without Words, Without Silence"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "48ef3a58d83733ab7901ad45ae1c2840"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Without revealing his own penetration, He offered another's words, not his to give. Had he chattered on and on, Even his listeners would have been embarrassed."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_260 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_235,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fb5458e64f33300417b000b72bf5ddf3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 17 ;
    neo:text "'I am going to follow you all the rest of my life,' declared the man."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2601 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2303,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2602,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2603,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2604,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2605 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "25. Preaching from the Third Seat"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "348f6e28bf2e1bffa735c1f26da2dcad"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "In a dream Kyozan went to Maitreya's Pure Land. He recognized himself seated in the third seat in the abode of Maitreya. Someone announced: \"Today the one who sits in the third seat will preach.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2606 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2602,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2607,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2608,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2609,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_47,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_87 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "25. Preaching from the Third Seat"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c563c9ced70608e6aa879b1f67bd4d77"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Kyozan arose and, hitting the gavel, said: \"The truth of Mahayana teaching is transcendent, above words and thought. Do you understand?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2610 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "25. Preaching from the Third Seat"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5614bb3bcc01ec21a2f09164f8c8a201"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: I want to ask you monks: Did he preach or did he not?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2611 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2612,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2613,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2614,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_47 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "25. Preaching from the Third Seat"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e895cebe15760488f6077ae45640b3eb"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "When he opens his mouth he is lost. When he seals his mouth he is lost. If he does not open it, if he does not seal it, he is 108,000 miles from truth."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2615 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1469,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2210,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2616,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2617,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "25. Preaching from the Third Seat"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "cae595bcf56ed1b0a032d3e96611c8ab"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "In the light of day, Yet in a dream he talks of a dream. A monster among monsters, He intended to deceive the whole crowd."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2618 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_139,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1472,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1657,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1740,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2619,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2620,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2621,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_335 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "26. Two Monks Roll Up the Screen"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "180d0a416dde99d213eea5e60182cb76"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Hogen of Seiryo monastery was about to lecture before dinner when he noticed that the bamboo screen lowered for meditation had not been rolled up. He pointed to it. Two monks arose from the audience and rolled it up."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_262 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_199,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_263,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_264 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4e3de68f8443bf59a1ce9d70745467ff"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 18 ;
    neo:text "Modern Zen teachers in Japan spring from the lineage of a famous master who was the successor of Gudo. His name was Mu-nan, the man who never returned back."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2622 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1740,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2623,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2624,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2625 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "26. Two Monks Roll Up the Screen"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6495130fd0f0fa3cd47319faa7c0db1f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Hogen, observing the physical moment, said: \"The state of the first monk is good, not that of the other.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2626 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_178,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2627,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2628,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2629 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "26. Two Monks Roll Up the Screen"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6b6ee0f5b6121aa024e179a50587435f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: I want to ask you: Which of those two monks gained and which lost? If any of you has one eye, he will see the failure on the teacher's part. However, I am not discussing gain and loss."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2630 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2039,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2631,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_788 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "26. Two Monks Roll Up the Screen"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f066bf33ce4eafd0d43784258cdd0f3e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "When the screen is rolled up the great sky opens, Yet the sky is not attuned to Zen. It is best to forget the great sky And to retire from every wind."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2632 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "27. It Is Not Mind, It Is Not Buddha, It Is Not Things"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d99ddb2dcb4bf916f7f992b362347c2c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A monk asked Nansen: \"Is there a teaching no master ever preached before?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2633 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2634 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "27. It Is Not Mind, It Is Not Buddha, It Is Not Things"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "176f72383ff9e9f74544f391480cddfc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Nansen said: \"Yes, there is.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2635 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_347 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "27. It Is Not Mind, It Is Not Buddha, It Is Not Things"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "91e8b18c543defde909731c74bf9bdde"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "\"What is it?\" asked the monk."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2636 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_252,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "27. It Is Not Mind, It Is Not Buddha, It Is Not Things"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c7e0a92ca0c90935ac4e8c163bfac3cf"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Nansen replied: \"It is not mind, it is not Buddha, it is not things.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2637 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2638,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2639 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "27. It Is Not Mind, It Is Not Buddha, It Is Not Things"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d7b282f66c7a94bf2e9689cccb7de712"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Old Nansen gave away his treasure-words. He must have been greatly upset."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2640 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1769,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2641,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_402,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_410,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_87,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "27. It Is Not Mind, It Is Not Buddha, It Is Not Things"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "92a852b0f261ad416009d768e830ca86"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Nansen was too kind and lost his treasure. Truly, words have no power. Even though the mountain becomes the sea, Words cannot open another's mind."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2642 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2643,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7fe4ff329e750e6d5dbed6c83884f8b7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Tokusan was studying Zen under Ryutan. One night he came to Ryutan and asked many questions. The teacher said: \"The night is getting old. Why don't you retire?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2644 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2039,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2645,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2646 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "01592ccd20300e3dcfa7cba33019990a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "So Tokusan bowed and opened the screen to go out, observing: \"It is very dark outside.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2647 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2117,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2643,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ca29c159ec11a8d41cccad02e5634cd3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Ryutan offered Tokusan a lighted candle to find his way. Just as Tokusan received it, Ryutan blew it out. At that moment the mind of Tokusan was opened."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2648 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2643 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8afe4e3dfc149e171e56f98474c814ae"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "\"What have you attained?\" asked Ryutan. \"From now on,\" said Tokusan, \"I will not doubt the teacher's words.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2649 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_251,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2537,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2643,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2650,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2651,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2652,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2653 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ec834fc9262c68d9b8d84831b301adbf"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "The next day Ryutan told the monks at his lecture: \"I see one monk among you. His teeth are like the sword tree, his mouth is like the blood bowl. If you hit him hard with a big stick, he will not even so much as look back at you. Someday he will mount the highest peak and carry my teaching there.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_265 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_266,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_267,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_268,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_269 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Is That So?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "23880d51ad2a3066975b4c1fa63cf670"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "The Zen master Hakuin was praised by his neighbors as one living a pure life."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2654 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2319,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2655,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2656,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2657,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2658,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_503 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "33ce41bf5973cfc21aa7e27949628ed2"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "On that day, in front of the lecture hall, Tokusan burned to ashes his commentaries on the sutras. He said: \"However abstruse the teachings are, in comparison with this enlightenment they are like a single hair to the great sky. However profound the complicated knowledge of the world, compared to this enlightenment it is like one drop of water to the great ocean.\" Then he left that monastery."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2659 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2312,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2643,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2660,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2661,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_297,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_339 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d6cd2ca0862df1b81b1da95e1ed16827"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: When Tokusan was in his own country he was not satisfied with Zen although he had heard about it. He thought: \"Those Southern monks say they can teach Dharma outside of the sutras. They are all wrong. I must teach them.\" So he traveled south. He happened to stop near Ryutan's monastery for refreshments. An old woman who was there asked him: \"What are you carrying so heavily?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2662 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2663,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2664 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5cb2cf251f7d4a000280c6bd6e486125"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "Tokusan replied: \"This is a commentary I have made on the Diamond Sutra after many years of work.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2665 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_188,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2666,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2667,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2668,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2669,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_357,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_626 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "999ca9adb4d96a232e01184513270f55"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:text "The old woman said: \"I read that sutra which says: 'The past mind cannot be held, the present mind cannot be held, the future mind cannot be held.' You wish some tea and refreshments. Which mind do you propose to use for them?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2670 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_178,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_213,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2409 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b386a79a7282f4637b3b53c278c34efb"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:text "Tokusan was as though dumb. Finally he asked the woman: \"Do you know of any good teacher around here?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2671 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2643,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_357 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f0bd12b2f0af701fa54f0332b29b4d22"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:text "The old woman referred him to Ryutan, not more than five miles away. So he went to Ryutan in all humility, quite different from when he had started his journey. Ryutan in turn was so kind he forgot his own dignity. It was like pouring muddy water over a drunken man to sober him. After all, it was an unnecessary comedy."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2672 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_178,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2673,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2674,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2675 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2a05487d49193529f722d1fa178e3e64"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:text "A hundred hearings cannot surpass one seeing, But after you see the teacher, that one glance cannot surpass a"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2676 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1289,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2677,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "28. Blow Out the Candle"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "891473b17297f75b3a83ac743872dad9"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 13 ;
    neo:text "hundred hearings. His nose was very high But he was blind after all."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2678 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2679,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2680,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2681 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "29. Not the Wind, Not the Flag"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "36306d8ab46268de6bb548a620ada7da"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Two monks were arguing about a flag. One said: \"The flag is moving.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2682 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_537,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_788 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "29. Not the Wind, Not the Flag"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "eb7675db130b549e1b81621a1460fbd8"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "The other said: \"The wind is moving.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2683 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2562,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2681,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_788,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "29. Not the Wind, Not the Flag"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c8294199ca4120678b8c645b5c9e1887"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "The sixth patriarch happened to be passing by. He told them: \"Not the wind, not the flag; mind is moving.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2684 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1069,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2492,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2568,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2621,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2681,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2685,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2686,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2687,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_788,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "29. Not the Wind, Not the Flag"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ed236e8db101d17af5da5fa51442d50a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: The sixth patriarch said: \"The wind is not moving, the flag is not moving. Mind is moving.\" What did he mean? If you understand this intimately, you will see the two monks there trying to buy iron and gaining gold. The sixth patriarch could not bear to see those two dull heads, so he made such a bargain."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2688 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_151,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1794,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2612,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2681,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_788,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "29. Not the Wind, Not the Flag"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b4b2eba66ff3cb418bac4ab51eaaa326"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Wind, flag, mind moves, The same understanding. When the mouth opens All are wrong."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2689 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2690,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_936 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "30. This Mind Is Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "681f4616f4a314a09d5ecca8c2cdce3a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Daibai asked Baso: \"What is Buddha?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2691 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_936 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "30. This Mind Is Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "02a6dfa257e243a9d9c4404cf67f447f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Baso said: \"This mind is Buddha.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2692 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2693,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2694,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2695,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2696,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2697,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_587,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_87,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_872,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "30. This Mind Is Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0f1b11fd1d700ea99825794878562934"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: If anyone wholly understands this, he is wearing Buddha's clothing, he is eating Buddha's food, he is speaking Buddha's words, he is behaving as Buddha, he is Buddha. This anecdote, however, has given many a pupil the sickness of formality. If one truly understands, he will wash out his mouth for three days after saying the word Buddha, and he will close his ears and flee after hearing \"This mind is Buddha.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2698 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2699,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2700,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2701,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_623,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "30. This Mind Is Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "42187619d8629a0d5a8d826373a98acb"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Under blue sky, in bright sunlight, One need not search around. Asking what Buddha is Is like hiding loot in one's pocket and declaring oneself innocent."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_270 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_220,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_271,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_272,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_273 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Is That So?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "24e9f1c9fc42a482c4285921e631ce14"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "A beautiful Japanese girl whose parents owned a food store lived near him. Suddenly, without any warning her parents discovered she was with child."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2702 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1774,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2703,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2704,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_339 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "31. Joshu Investigates"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "78778bd75a0b961dcb3283ff87b8d868"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A traveling monk asked an old woman the road to Taizan, a popular temple supposed to give wisdom to the one who worships there. The old woman said: \"Go straight ahead.\" When the monk proceeded a few steps, she said to herself: \"He also is a common church-goer.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2705 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1603,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2298,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2706,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_339,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_441,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "31. Joshu Investigates"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "33322e938ddc6dba4c600ed644a3b352"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Someone told this incident to Joshu, who said: \"Wait until I investigate.\" The next day he went and asked the same question, and the old woman gave the same answer."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2707 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_339,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "31. Joshu Investigates"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "10e29a4bc5c28fb8f9b4911f7bda538e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Joshu remarked: \"I have investigated that old woman.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2708 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2709,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2710,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2711,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2712,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2713,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2714,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_339 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "31. Joshu Investigates"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5e36b7e94db19791ee5cb52930a68835"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: The old woman understood how war is planned, but she did not know how spies sneak in behind her tent. Old Joshu played the spy's work and turned the tables on her, but he was not an able general. Both had their faults. Now I want to ask you: What was the point of Joshu's investigating the old woman?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2715 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1603,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1707,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2298,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2716,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2717,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2718,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2719 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "31. Joshu Investigates"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e7d085a27a162a43e8ce2e091a40b644"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "When the question is common The answer is also common. When the question is sand in a bowl of boiled rice The answer is a stick in the soft mud."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2720 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2721,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_47,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "32. A Philosopher Asks Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5f7161da1150683494bbf38191f94c17"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A philosopher asked Buddha: \"Without words, without the wordless, will you tell me truth?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2722 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2351,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_899 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "32. A Philosopher Asks Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f98a3db7ec85749d70daff9cbae153da"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "The Buddha kept silence."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2723 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2721,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2724,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2725,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2726,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "32. A Philosopher Asks Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9ee4935c640347f662ca74c761dcec1b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "The philosopher bowed and thanked the Buddha, saying: \"With your loving kindness I have cleared away my delusions and entered the true path.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2727 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2351,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2728,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_54 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "32. A Philosopher Asks Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "05e46181e98f1d41a4dcd846a9154758"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "After the philosopher had gone, Ananda asked the Buddha what he had attained."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2729 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2351,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2730,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2731 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "32. A Philosopher Asks Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1ffecc6c8072dfbb89a5a3ea8eb3455b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "The Buddha replied: \"A good horse runs even at the shadow of the whip.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2732 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2733,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_44,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_54,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "32. A Philosopher Asks Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b109a2a08e4ff75cdb91db72434ab718"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Ananda was the disciple of the Buddha. Even so, his opinion did not surpass that of outsiders. I want to ask you monks: How much difference is there between disciples and outsiders?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2734 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1178,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2735,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2736,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2737,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2738,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2739,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2740 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "32. A Philosopher Asks Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "602f08b7ebd136edd0c1295bd68a233a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "To tread the sharp edge of a sword, To run on smooth-frozen ice, One needs no footsteps to follow. Walk over the cliffs with hands free."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_274 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_266,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_272,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_275 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Is That So?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0519364c54956c203cf1c2aec21a4331"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "This made her parents angry. She would not confess who the man was, but after much harassment at last named Hakuin."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2741 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_936 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "33. This Mind Is Not Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1bcc25fe6bf269d52ab0732cec060383"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A monk asked Baso: \"What is Buddha?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2742 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_936 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "33. This Mind Is Not Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d15736c16b3ca6ba2379e2ae1d9f4b58"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Baso said: \"This mind is not Buddha.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2743 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "33. This Mind Is Not Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "deeee06b3d6021bc6a8a60cc841c91b9"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: If anyone understands this, he is a graduate of Zen."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2744 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2745,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2746 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "33. This Mind Is Not Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0679b43e70fc3a8ec5b6cb2689176263"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "If you meet a fencing-master on the road, you may give him your"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2747 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1178,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_448,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_462 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "33. This Mind Is Not Buddha"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7fefa3a4ac76e16afe8a2f25f04b95c0"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "sword, If you meet a poet, you may offer him your poem. When you meet others, say only a part of what you intend. Never give the whole thing at once."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2748 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1434,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2749,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "34. Learning Is Not the Path"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e116af35d0f98009b5854b5bbf59ca57"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Nansen said: \"Mind is not Buddha. Learning is not the path.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2750 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1789,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2425,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2751,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_603,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_671 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "34. Learning Is Not the Path"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ca0cf7e0665062eb9191d4a50201c88f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Nansen was getting old and forgot to be ashamed. He spoke out with bad breath and exposed the scandal of his own home. However, there are few who appreciate his kindness."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2752 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2214,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2290,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_232,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_233,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2522,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2753,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2754,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "34. Learning Is Not the Path"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fb4d34e3d392eb48bb565b59b232ccd8"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "When the sky is clear the sun appears, When the earth is parched rain will fall. He opened his heart fully and spoke out, But it was useless to talk to pigs and fish."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2755 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2344,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2756,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2757,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2758,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2759,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2760,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2761,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2762,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_603 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "35. Two Souls"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4796a03e00f8b1fd037a0c582cdb5df6"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "\"Seijo, the Chinese girl,\" observed Goso, \"had two souls, one always sick at home and the other in the city, a married woman with two children. Which was the true soul?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_276 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_277,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_76 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Is That So?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f4552c9f76bede5339ed8510b561570f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "In great anger the parents went to the master. 'Is that so?' was all he would say."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2763 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_151,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2764,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2765,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2766,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2767,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2768,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_63,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_656 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "35. Two Souls"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "bfe86c6df77b44c2e587a64d2cffd907"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: When one understands this, he will know it is possible to come out from one shell and enter another, as if one were stopping at a transient lodging house. But if he cannot understand, when his time comes and his four elements separate, he will be just like a crab dipped in boiling water, struggling with many hands and legs. In such a predicament he may say: \"Mumon did not tell me where to go!\" but it will be too late then."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2769 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1263,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2259,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2770,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2771,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2772,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2773,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_420,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_621 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "35. Two Souls"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "689b1c202c5ae801bca5e767d4ffbb62"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "The moon above the clouds is the same moon, The mountains and rivers below are all different. Each is happy in its unity and variety. This is one, this is two."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2774 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_267,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2746,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2756,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_899 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "36. Meeting a Zen Master on the Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "603d72051211519338e1b0d8a40a98ac"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Goso said: \"When you meet a Zen master on the road you cannot talk to him, you cannot face him with silence. What are you going to do?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2775 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1890,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "36. Meeting a Zen Master on the Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "707f5a9361a37adedd831cb00b7f92d0"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: In such a case, if you can answer him intimately, your realization will be beautiful, but if you cannot, you should look about without seeing anything."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2776 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_267,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2746,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2777,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2778,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_87,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_899 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "36. Meeting a Zen Master on the Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "eb09b731a0a413eb9fb07a045daac5ca"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Meeting a Zen master on the road, Face him neither with words nor silence. Give him an uppercut And you will be called one who understands Zen."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2779 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1548,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2756,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2780,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2781,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2782,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2783,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2784,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2785 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "37. A Buffalo Passes Through the Enclosure"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "75a6c1d428c8916c26dc260e9194ea7f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Goso said: \"When a buffalo goes out of his enclosure to the edge of the abyss, his horns and his head and his hoofs all pass through, but why can't the tail also pass?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_278 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_266,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_268,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_279,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_280,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_281 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Is That So?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4ef43a825b5e1d1e30bf103a8f909875"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "After the child was born it was brought to Hakuin. By this time he had lost his reputation, which did not trouble him, but he took very good care of the child. He obtained milk from his neighbors and everything else the little one needed."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2786 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2787,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2788,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_860 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "37. A Buffalo Passes Through the Enclosure"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7ffdac568538cc3a2e74448862430fc1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: If anyone can open one eye at this point and say a word of Zen, he is qualified to repay the four gratifications, and, not only that, he can save all sentient beings under him. But if he cannot say such a word of true Zen, he should turn back to his tail."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2789 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2780,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2785,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2790 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "37. A Buffalo Passes Through the Enclosure"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6c5b3530594d11c1e20c888f9e721e37"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "If the buffalo runs, he will fall into the trench; If he returns, he will be butchered. That little tail Is a very strange thing."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2792 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_39,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_40,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "38. An Oak Tree in the Garden"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "37a504a8ae68e3744b01e761f46687ff"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A monk asked Joshu why Bodhidharma came to China."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2793 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1651,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2794,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "38. An Oak Tree in the Garden"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ecd2b0bd1d2a871a671a9154eacfce9f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Joshu said: \"An oak tree in the garden.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2795 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2796,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2797,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2798,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_680 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "38. An Oak Tree in the Garden"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "64abeca34c505adef51ef53df5062e4d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: If one sees Joshu's answer clearly, there is no Shakyamuni Buddha before him and no future Buddha after him."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2799 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2259,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2613,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2800,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_503,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_87 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "38. An Oak Tree in the Garden"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e737a00798938063f7cd250e504c8212"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Words cannot describe everything. The heart's message cannot be delivered in words. If one receives words literally, he will be lost, If he tries to explain with words, he will not attain enlightenment in"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2801 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2802 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "38. An Oak Tree in the Garden"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7cf07e412a1942db9dfa7826723c5c35"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "this life."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2803 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_135,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1729,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2804,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "39. Ummon's Sidetrack"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d90b9530e158162a7fda47e973684320"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A Zen student told Ummon: \"Brilliancy of Buddha illuminates the whole universe.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2805 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "39. Ummon's Sidetrack"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "71ca84284f026f3eceeb8e0ebac2de68"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Before he finished the phrase Ummon asked: \"You are reciting another's poem, are you not?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2807 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_641 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "39. Ummon's Sidetrack"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "383024dfbab980d1cf1f960ec8f6a687"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "\"Yes,\" answered the student."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2808 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "39. Ummon's Sidetrack"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c79dbf3cce90fd81e0124813e5948676"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "\"You are sidetracked,\" said Ummon."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2810 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2811,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2812,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_428,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_633 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "39. Ummon's Sidetrack"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1ca0623b214037e82b3d3250d6a64660"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Afterwards another teacher, Shishin, asked his pupils: \"At what point did that student go off the track?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2813 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_178,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2812,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2814,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2815,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_633,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_697 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "39. Ummon's Sidetrack"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "42d131f8643290193e6e31176dafef3e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: If anyone perceives Ummon's particular skillfulness, he will know at what point the student was off the track, and he will be a teacher of man and Devas. If not, he cannot even perceive himself."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2816 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_169,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_232,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2612,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2817,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2818,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2819 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "39. Ummon's Sidetrack"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d83638ed27322a3a335fcc9cb0e1e440"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "When a fish meets the fishhook If he is too greedy, he will be caught. When his mouth opens His life already is lost."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_282 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_283,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_284,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_285,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_286,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_287 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Is That So?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5d8544ac202dbd1bd1eeb6bd81a309fd"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "A year later the girl-mother could stand it no longer. She told her parents the truth--that the real father of the child was a young man who worked in the fish market."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2820 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1603,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2319,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2821,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_428 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "40. Tipping Over a Water Vase"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1ade3ce31e914e1608c658944ba47be6"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Hyakujo wished to send a monk to open a new monastery. He told his pupils that whoever answered a question most ably would be appointed. Placing a water vase on the ground, he asked: \"Who can say what this is without calling its name?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2822 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2237,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2823 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "40. Tipping Over a Water Vase"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f771fb355014c197ab81c6209abab816"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "The chief monk said: \"No one can call it a wooden shoe.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2824 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2825,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2826,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_340 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "40. Tipping Over a Water Vase"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1e441fbfe84c698fb75a29a93e20ff92"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Isan, the cooking monk, tipped over the vase with his foot and went out."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2827 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2825,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2828 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "40. Tipping Over a Water Vase"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "338d707deeda5a6e15700f4fd5c0ba2f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Hyakujo smiled and said: \"The chief monk loses.\" And Isan became the master of the new monastery."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2829 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2825,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2830,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2831,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2832,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2833,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2834 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "40. Tipping Over a Water Vase"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a8d6a9d3de68ce42ca1a87870eafb584"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Isan was brave enough, but he could not escape Hyakujo's trick. After all, he gave up a light job and took a heavy one. Why, can't you see, he took off his comfortable hat and placed himself in iron stocks."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2835 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1926,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1976,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2351,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2836,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2837,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2838,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2839,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "40. Tipping Over a Water Vase"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c92d1aad0df480237f78f7c204991f22"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Giving up cooking utensils, Defeating the chatterbox, Though his teacher sets a barrier for him His feet will tip over everything, even the Buddha."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2840 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1622,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2065,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2841,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_39,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_433,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "41. Bodhidharma Pacifies the Mind"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a6a4a9d27b5c58fc5c9cf04a84706857"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Bodhidharma sits facing the wall. His future successor stands in the snow and presents his severed arm to Bodhidharma. He cries: \"My mind is not pacified. Master, pacify my mind.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2842 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_39,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "41. Bodhidharma Pacifies the Mind"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "dec74c9eded09184176e2c912d21b1ca"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Bodhidharma says: \"If you bring me that mind, I will pacify it for you.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2843 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2844,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2845 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "41. Bodhidharma Pacifies the Mind"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "21e9a1f931de3314f6732b8fe1273e98"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "The successor says: \"When I search my mind I cannot hold it.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2846 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_39,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "41. Bodhidharma Pacifies the Mind"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a02503d2145802afb68e8deca95df6a4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Bodhidharma says: \"Then your mind is pacified already.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2847 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2848,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_30,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_39,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_40 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "41. Bodhidharma Pacifies the Mind"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5f954d570d765e97a18b127927ee12e8"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: That broken-toothed old Hindu, Bodhidharma, came thousands of miles over the sea from India to China as if he had something wonderful. He is like raising waves without wind. After he remained years in China he had only one disciple and that one lost his arm and was deformed. Alas, ever since he has had brainless disciples."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2849 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2850,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_39,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_40,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_463 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "41. Bodhidharma Pacifies the Mind"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "742cc64c9a6889596e26da098d804bf7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Why did Bodhidharma come to China? For years monks have discussed this. All the troubles that have followed since Came from that teacher and disciple."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2851 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2558,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2852,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2853,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2854,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2855,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_291,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_55 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "42. The Girl Comes Out from Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9664b952f6e93325e46ad7da01947503"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "In the time of Buddha Shakyamuni, Manjusri went to the assemblage of the Buddhas. When he arrived there, the conference was over and each Buddha had returned to his own Buddha-land. Only one girl was yet unmoved in deep meditation."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2856 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2852,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2853,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2857,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_346 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "42. The Girl Comes Out from Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a1a84186273f9f339902c49adf0de221"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Manjusri asked Buddha Shakyamuni how it was possible for this girl to reach this state, one which even he could not attain. \"Bring her out from Samadhi and ask her yourself,\" said the Buddha."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2858 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_139,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2853,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2859,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2860,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_346 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "42. The Girl Comes Out from Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e7990779722d960fced349ac7942e4d7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Manjusri walked around the girl three times and snapped his fingers. She still remained in meditation. So by his miracle power he transported her to a high heaven and tried his best to call her, but in vain."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2861 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2852,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2853,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2862,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2863,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2864,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2865 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "42. The Girl Comes Out from Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9c5f8f56fbc5075507b8bc43081c2efa"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Buddha Shakyamuni said: \"Even a hundred thousand Manjusris could not disturb her, but below this place, past twelve hundred million countries, is a Bodhisattva, Mo-myo, seed of delusion. If he comes here, she will awaken.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2866 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2854,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2864,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_346,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "42. The Girl Comes Out from Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d2cbc23bb82c78c54d8ebec9cc3fb2b6"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "No sooner had the Buddha spoken than that Bodhisattva sprang up from the earth and bowed and paid homage to the Buddha. Buddha directed him to arouse the girl. The Bodhisattva went in front of the girl and snapped his fingers, and in that instant the girl came out from her deep meditation."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2867 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_139,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2853,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2864,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2868,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2869,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2870,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_346 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "42. The Girl Comes Out from Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "70da0e69f34239dd8a626c7f386769d3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Old Shakyamuni set a very poor stage. I want to ask you monks: If Manjusri, who is supposed to have been the teacher of seven Buddhas, could not bring this girl out of meditation, how then could a Bodhisattva who was a mere beginner?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2871 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2872,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2873 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "42. The Girl Comes Out from Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ca4a0fe3564b0b720f2c4cb83d82160c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "If you understand this intimately, you yourself can enter the great meditation while you are living in the world of delusion."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2874 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2259,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2875,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2876,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2877,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2878,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2879,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_329,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_537 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "42. The Girl Comes Out from Meditation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4319af728309e583179bb4059a62544d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "One could not awaken her, the other could. Neither are good actors. One wears the mask of god, one a devil's mask. Had both failed, the drama still would be a comedy."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_288 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_266,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_289,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_290,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_291 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Is That So?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "feff2a84719d59413f765aee17a4f04a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "The mother and father of the girl at once went to Hakuin to ask his forgiveness, to apologize at length, and to get the child back again."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2880 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2881,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2882 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "43. Shuzan's Short Staff"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "435c15d51d4b9056e280d6fa8a5571e3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Shuzan held out his short staff and said: \"If you call this a short staff, you oppose its reality. If you do not call it a short staff, you ignore the fact. Now what do you wish to call this?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2883 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2882,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2884,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_71,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_87 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "43. Shuzan's Short Staff"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5a90ff88064fe750a0b43ea5e9cad408"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: If you call this a short staff, you oppose its reality. If you do not call it a short staff, you ignore the fact. It cannot be expressed with words and it cannot be expressed without words. Now say quickly what it is."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2885 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2195,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2558,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2882,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2886,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2887,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2888,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2889,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "43. Shuzan's Short Staff"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "03ea3911e0c8a1c45e76b273c1144046"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Holding out the short staff, He gave an order of life or death. Positive and negative interwoven, Even Buddhas and patriarchs cannot escape this attack."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2890 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2891,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_463,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_608 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "44. Basho's Staff"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0280864a26b7bd035bedc1ba2a36c189"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Basho said to his disciple: \"When you have a staff, I will give it to you. If you have no staff, I will take it away from you.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2892 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1165,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1381,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2893,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2894,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2895,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_608 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "44. Basho's Staff"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4e0609ce63b79a58dece72babc13f0b8"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: When there is no bridge over the creek the staff will help me. When I return home on a moonless night the staff will accompany me. But if you call this a staff, you will enter hell like an arrow."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2896 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1641,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1665,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2214,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2540,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_608 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "44. Basho's Staff"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5cdc14dfc47968ead1e3abf679856154"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "With this staff in my hand I can measure the depths and shallows of the world. The staff supports the heavens and makes firm the earth. Everywhere it goes the true teaching will be spread."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2897 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2898,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2899,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2900 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "45. Who Is He?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9a93dabd53355adeca1ab25271376028"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Hoen said: \"The past and future Buddhas, both are his servants. Who is he?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2901 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_290,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2902,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2903 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "45. Who Is He?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4151ad6f4c21a877462e602d30fcae49"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: If you realize clearly who he is, it is as if you met your own father on a busy street. There is no need to ask anyone whether or not your recognition is true."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2904 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1518,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1760,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2714,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2905,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2906 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "45. Who Is He?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "61ae88e1bd24dcbc9b45374eac47b8e4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Do not fight with another's bow and arrow. Do not ride another's horse. Do not discuss another's faults. Do not interfere with another's work."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2907 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2908,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2909,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2910,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2911,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "46. Proceed from the Top of the Pole"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3b7e164b49773ba602e585e6bfa89b7e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Sekiso asked: \"How can you proceed on from the top of a hundred-foot pole?\" Another Zen teacher said: \"One who sits on the top of a hundred- foot pole has attained a certain height but still is not handling Zen freely. He should proceed on from there and appear with his whole body in the ten parts of the world.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2912 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2913,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2914 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "46. Proceed from the Top of the Pole"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ff446711c0347151db86a45e1f4ade8c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: One can continue his steps or turn his body freely about on the top of the pole. In either case he should be respected. I want to ask you monks, however: How will you proceed from the top of that pole? Look out!"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2915 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2916,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2917,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2918,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2919,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_925 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "46. Proceed from the Top of the Pole"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "30b4df11c0657bf50fd19d23df665061"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "The man who lacks the third eye of insight Will cling to the measure of the hundred feet. Such a man will jump from there and kill himself, Like a blind man misleading other blind men."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_292 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_266,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_285 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "3. Is That So?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e186a31755c6fc8691f64d2bcbfa7e62"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "Hakuin was willing. In yielding the child, all he said was, 'Is that so?'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2920 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_141,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_173,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2921,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2922,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2923,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "47. Three Gates of Tosotsu"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "45843f58cc52cce004d274cc9a4afbbd"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Tosotsu built three barriers and made the monks pass through them. The first barrier is studying Zen. In studying Zen the aim is to see one's own true nature. Now where is your true nature?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2924 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1322,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_141,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1772,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2078,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2242,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2358,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_59,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_656 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "47. Three Gates of Tosotsu"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d3ca4dbc9ff2b046a3ad6a04efd31716"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Secondly, when one realizes his own true nature he will be free from birth and death. Now when you shut the light from your eyes and become a corpse, how can you free yourself?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2925 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2078,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2204,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_261,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_63,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_656 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "47. Three Gates of Tosotsu"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9909e61c87b9fb149ad712e42b9008c4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Thirdly, if you free yourself from birth and death, you should know where you are. Now your body separates into the four elements. Where are you?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2926 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2922,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_333 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "47. Three Gates of Tosotsu"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "679dde7357a2a2aff3738a65c610e3d8"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: Whoever can pass these three barriers will be a master wherever he stands. Whatever happens about him he will turn into Zen."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2927 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2928,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "47. Three Gates of Tosotsu"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7b6c51e09e59c1b0915792761b695f91"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Otherwise he will be living on poor food and not even enough of that to satisfy himself."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2929 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2259,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2930,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2931,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2932,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2933 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "47. Three Gates of Tosotsu"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "285856b177108f9228822a3a522d08e4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "An instant realization sees endless time. Endless time is as one moment. When one comprehends the endless moment He realizes the person who is seeing it."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_293 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_294,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_295,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_296,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_297,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_298,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_299,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_300 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "4. Obedience"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9c4eb7205559e05069242c4ac0271ad4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "The master Bankei's talks were attended not only by Zen students but by persons of all ranks and sects. He never quoted sutras nor indulged in scholastic dissertations. Instead his words were spoken directly from his heart to the harts of his listeners."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2934 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2178,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2558,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2935,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2936,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2937,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2938 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "48. One Road of Kembo"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "442c73d6d198c79d01f03bfefda3e606"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A Zen pupil asked Kembo: \"All Buddhas of the ten parts of the universe enter the one road of Nirvana. Where does that road begin?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2939 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2936,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2940,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2941 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "48. One Road of Kembo"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "981168c30a54c45f9b4926b9c28b4bed"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Kembo, raising his walking stick and drawing the figure one in the air, said: \"Here it is.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2942 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2437,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2943,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2944,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2945,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2946,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2947,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2948,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_872 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "48. One Road of Kembo"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "214f0869405f586960636518999784fa"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "This pupil went to Ummon and asked the same question. Ummon, who happened to have a fan in his hand, said: \"This fan will reach to the thirty- third heaven and hit the nose of the presiding deity there. It is like the Dragon Carp of the Eastern Sea tipping over the rain-cloud with his tail.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2949 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1777,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2214,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2746,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2936,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2950,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2951,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2952,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2953 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "48. One Road of Kembo"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e4613bdb99f665db903e95d3bc71cc5e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Mumon's comment: One teacher enters the deep sea and scratches the earth and raises dust. The other goes to the mountain top and raises waves that almost touch heaven. One holds, the other gives out. Each supports the profound teaching with a single hand. Kembo and Ummon are like two riders neither of whom can surpass the other. It is very difficult to find the perfect man. Frankly, neither of them know where the road starts."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2954 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2384,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2955,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2956,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2957,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2958,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2959,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_822 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "48. One Road of Kembo"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "46aa031fdcc8f9594f6b112c73d58659"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Before the first step is taken the goal is reached. Before the tongue is moved the speech is finished. More than brilliant intuition is needed To find the origin of the right road."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2960 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2685,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2961,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2962,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2963,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2964,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2965,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_525 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "49. Amban's Addition"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "524372a9e23cd01a2c42ff48cad8755c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Amban, a layman Zen student, said: \"Mumon has just published forty-eight koans and called the book Gateless Gate. He criticizes the old patriarchs' words and actions. I think he is very mischievous. He is like an old doughnut seller trying to catch a passerby to force his doughnuts down his mouth. The customer can neither swallow nor spit out the doughnuts, and this causes suffering. Mumon has annoyed everyone enough, so I think I shall add one more as a bargain. I wonder if he himself can eat this bargain."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2966 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2110,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2967,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2968,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_355 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "49. Amban's Addition"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3ea2ad936a0d402f0a8a6cdba6c0cec5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "If he can, and digest it well, it will be fine, but if not, we will have to put it back into the frying pan with his forty-eight also and cook them again. Mumon, you eat first, before someone else does:"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2969 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1385,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1386,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2416,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_626,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "49. Amban's Addition"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "386cf0f65d7b013029299ba810570a0b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "\"Buddha, according to a sutra, once said: 'Stop, stop. Do not speak. The ultimate truth is not even to think.'\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2970 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2186,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2961,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_40,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_626,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_90 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "49. Amban's Addition"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "63ec2b111561320530bcc07e85d5136e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Amban's comment: Where did that so-called teaching come from? How is it that one could not even think it? Suppose someone spoke about it then what became of it? Buddha himself was a great chatterbox and in this sutra spoke contrarily. Because of this, persons like Mumon appear afterwards in China and make useless doughnuts, annoying people. What shall we do after all? I will show you."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2971 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2416,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2961,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2962,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2972,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2973,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_626 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "49. Amban's Addition"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d0cbc38a8c353e5c839704f2d2629b9c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Then Amban put his palms together, folded his hands, and said: \"Stop, stop. Do not speak. The ultimate truth is not even to think. And now I will make a little circle on the sutra with my finger and add that five thousand other sutras and Vimalakirti's gateless gate all are here!\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2974 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1744,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2975,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_59 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "THE GATELESS GATE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "49. Amban's Addition"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3769ee83dcfc2e9b3eef75c16ab6dc82"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "If anyone tells you fire is light, Pay no attention. When two thieves meet they need no introduction: They recognize each other without question."^^xsd:string .

