    neo:h3 "5. Taming the Bull"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "275b262db8ef90baebb8cbf3d48e9557"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Comment: When one thought arises, another thought follows. When the first thought springs from enlightenment, all subsequent thoughts are true. Through delusion, one makes everything untrue. Delusion is not caused by objectivity; it is the result of subjectivity. Hold the nose-ring tight and do not allow even a doubt."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3043 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1644,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_205,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2985,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3044,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3045,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3046,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_370 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "10 BULLS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "6. Riding the Bull Home"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "915e8187b6f03ef40b6b9169b2b1ff10"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Mounting the bull, slowly I return homeward. The voice of my flute intones through the evening. Measuring with hand-beats the pulsating harmony, I direct the endless"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3047 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2053,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3048,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3049,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3050 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "10 BULLS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "6. Riding the Bull Home"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "74224308fd06e437947c6a009def4f80"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "rhythm. Whoever hears this melody will join me."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3051 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_209,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2627,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2628,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2985,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3018,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3030,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3052,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3053,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_370,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_526,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_621 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "10 BULLS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "6. Riding the Bull Home"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "14233571467fa33aafb441438156e022"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Comment: This struggle is over; gain and loss are assimilated. I sing the song of the village woodsman, and play the tunes of the children. Astride the bull, I observe the clouds above. Onward I go, no matter who may wish to call me back."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3054 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2992,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3037,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3039,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3055,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3056,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3057,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3058,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_370,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_403 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "10 BULLS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "7. The Bull Transcended"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "825259f67bf970c7250c778287a4f190"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Astride the bull, I reach home. I am serene. The bull too can rest. The dawn has come. In blissful repose, Within my thatched dwelling I have abandoned the whip and rope."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3059 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1069,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_232,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2931,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2985,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3060,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3061,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3062,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3063,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3064,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3065,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3066,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3067,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_420 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "10 BULLS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "7. The Bull Transcended"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4cdd324ad1add0d7e4707a6034778db5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Comment: All is one law, not two. We only make the bull a temporary subject. It is as the relation of rabbit and trap, of fish and net. It is as gold and dross, or the moon emerging from a cloud. One path of clear light travels on throughout endless time."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_306 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_235,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_307 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "4. Obedience"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a48859a5230b473783e067c8f13edfea"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "'Hey, Zen teacher,' he called out. 'Wait a minute. Whoever respects you will obey what you say, but a man like myself does not respect you. Can you make me obey yon?'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3068 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1744,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1772,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1777,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2090,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2195,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2985,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3001,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3037,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3039,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3069,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_69 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "10 BULLS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "8. Both Bull and Self Transcended"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "71259916f1bffc2a669333359dc0d941"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Whip, rope, person, and bull -- all merge in No-Thing. This heaven is so vast no message can stain it. How may a snowflake exist in a raging fire? Here are the footprints of the patriarchs."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3070 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1322,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1434,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1892,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2592,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3071,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3072,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_370,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_400,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_503,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "10 BULLS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "8. Both Bull and Self Transcended"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fb0c953f71105f99db0c93ee8bafc732"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Comment: Mediocrity is gone. Mind is clear of limitation. I seek no state of enlightenment. Neither do I remain where no enlightenment exists. Since I linger in neither condition, eyes cannot see me. If hundreds of birds strew my path with flowers, such praise would be meaningless."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3073 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1860,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3074,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3075,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3076,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3077,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3078,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3079 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "10 BULLS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "9. Reaching the Source"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "67472decd2989392059d969ff4b277d1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Too many steps have been taken returning to the root and the source. Better to have been blind and deaf from the beginning! Dwelling in one's true abode, unconcerned with that without -- The river flows tranquilly on and the flowers are red."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_308 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_294 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "4. Obedience"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "02daa1d55216a69f49fcec57c4cf25c9"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "'Come up beside me and I will show you,' said Bankei."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3080 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2083,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3081,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3082,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3083,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3084,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3085,
