    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Thanks are due the publishers named above for permission to gather the material together here. And most of all am I grateful to Nyogen Senzaki, 'homeless monk' exemplar-friend collaborator, who so delighted with me in transcribing the first three books, even as that prescient man of Kashmir, Lakshmanjoo, did on the fourth."^^xsd:string .

