    neo:h2 "What Is Zen?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9d14f198f3332d5596d02a4b5ed098e1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Try if you wish. But Zen comes of itself. True Zen shows in everyday living, CONSCIOUSNESS in action. More than any limited awareness, it opens every inner door to our infinite nature."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3604 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_172,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3605,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3606,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3607,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_97 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "What Is Zen?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2ab4d70781e222b6692d61b56d8e0fff"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Instantly mind frees. How it frees! False Zen wracks brains as a fiction concocted by priests and salesmen to peddle their own wares."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3608 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_121,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1621,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_1772,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3609 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "What Is Zen?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ef7e6a94fa31c372eb23ecf0af289869"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Look at it this way, inside out and outside in: CONSCIOUSNESS everywhere, inclusive, through you. Then you can't help living humbly, in wonder."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3610 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_31 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "What Is Zen?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d4911f18fff1f794cead9c2d811a6901"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "\"What is Zen?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3611 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_232,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3612,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3613,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3614,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_402 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "What Is Zen?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "50a1c9f1430963f60f3999daa865342f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "One answer: Inayat Khan tells a Hindu story of a fish who went to a queen fish and asked: \"I have always heard about the sea, but what is this sea? Where is it?\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3615 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_115,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3614,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_402 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "What Is Zen?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6a279d78b9544a9295bc5e031c9afeec"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "The queen fish explained: \"You live, move, and have your being in the sea. The sea is within you and without you, and you are made of sea, and you will end in sea. The sea surrounds you as your own being.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3616 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_2190,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3617,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_3618,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_7 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "What Is Zen?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "dfc4bd59bd72af1e7bd15cff9acf3dea"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "Another answer: * \"Mu\" is the negative symbol in Chinese, meaning \"No thing\" or \"Nay.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_362 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_275,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_347,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_363 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "6. No Loving-Kindness"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9eae46fa094d563f88e1f1c1e88129b9"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "She at once went to the hut of the monk and burned it down."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_364 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_365,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_366,
        ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_367 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "7. Announcement"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "283a8562d0d340acf98256fda3920eab"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Tanzan wrote sixty postal cards on the last day of his life, and asked an attendant to mail them. Then he passed away."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_151b43f1_567f_4578_b41f_d18c5e861cad_368 a neo:Document ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
